 "title": "-20 V P-channel HEXFET power MOSFET in Micro3 (SOT-23)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "April 28, 2014",
  "pages": 10
 },
 "summary": "A single P-channel HEXFET power MOSFET in the three-lead Micro3 (SOT-23) package, for battery and load management. It blocks -20 V and is specified with as little as -2.5 V on the gate: on-resistance is 0.065 Ω max at -4.5 V and 0.135 Ω max at -2.5 V. It carries -3.7 A continuously at 25 °C ambient and -22 A in pulses; the gate is rated ±12 V. Lead-free, halogen-free, RoHS compliant, MSL1.",
